                <pb facs="0751" n="645" sameAs="frus:frus1906p1/pg645"/>

                <head>[Inclosure—Memorandum.]</head>
                <p>The bill has come before the Bundesrath, and will immediately be submitted to the
                    Emperor for signature. In the meantime the Bundesrath has made use of the power
                    conferred upon this body and decided on Saturday last to grant, until further
                    notice, to the products of the United States the rates of the German
                    conventional tariff, without setting a term within the fixed time. As soon as
                    the act has received the signature of His Majesty it will be published, together
                    with the resolution of the Bundesrath.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
